WEBVTT

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:26.030
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:26.790
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:33.970
Your Majesty, there is a matter I 
must bring to your attention...

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:35.400
Speak.

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:37.270
Yes... Um...

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:39.130
What? Say it plainly.

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:43.940
We've received a letter from the 
Alliance of the Six Nations

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:46.850
requesting an explanation as to 
why we are gathering soldiers.

00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:48.150
What of it?

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:52.130
Perhaps we should cancel the martial 
arts tournament after all...

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:54.960
Oh, no! That's what you wanted to say?

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.190
Why?

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:58.540
I feel that having participants kill one

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:00.680
another exceeds the boundaries 
of a tournament...

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:04.520
Also, the prize offered to the winner...

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:06.560
Emperor Gaz's remains?

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:07.890
Yes.

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:12.010
I do not need to take anyone's 
orders regarding the tournament,

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:15.860
or offering the reward I received for 
subjugating the emperor as a prize.

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:16.940
But...

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:18.760
There's no other festival

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:21.080
as wonderful as this to be 
found in all of Verbist.

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:24.050
And you speak of canceling...

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:26.340
What a terrible shame, Father.

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:29.510
What do you intend to do, Father?

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:32.570
Arina, Irina, don't worry.

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:34.500
I will not cancel the tournament.

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:40.970
The Castle of Madness

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:00.320
Gathered so few...

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.370
Chaika!

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:03.530
Start a fire!

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.870
Surprised! Big catch!

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:08.140
Whirl, flames!

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:09.550
The Burner!

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:13.790
Many blessings of the sea!

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:15.560
Okay, it's done.

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:16.750
It's ready?

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:22.960
Want?

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:23.740
Want.

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:24.510
Give.

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:25.640
Accept.

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:29.620
You eat?

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:31.630
It doesn't have to be magic fuel?

00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:34.550
Biological organs. Nutrition necessary.

00:03:34.550 --> 00:03:35.650
She's not a machine?

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:39.940
Niva's body, likely used 
Fayla organs, parts.

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:45.040
You again?

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.580
So it was you all who got her.

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:50.950
You know her?

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:52.470
Who can say?

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:55.960
Even if I did, I'm not obligated 
to explain anything to you.

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:58.670
Have question! Want answer!

00:03:59.230 --> 00:04:00.230
Oh?

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:02.100
What am I?

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:04.470
You know that now, don't you?

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:06.450
Still have doubt.

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:08.220
Can't understand details.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.930
Am I tool? To gather remains?

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:13.690
If that's what you believe, 
then it's probably true.

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:18.320
Stop being cryptic and 
tell us why you're here.

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:20.380
I bring information on remains.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:25.760
King Stephan Hartgen of the Principality 
of Hartgen possesses remains.

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:29.020
Unfortunately for you, we already knew that.

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:31.370
We intend to head there tomorrow.

00:04:31.850 --> 00:04:32.780
Is that so?

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:35.830
But this time, it will take more 
than ordinary means to claim them.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:37.630
What do you mean?

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:40.210
I suppose it's about a day 
from here by vehicle...

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:43.370
I hope the other Chaika 
doesn't beat you there.

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:48.230
I don't like him... I don't like him.

00:04:48.230 --> 00:04:50.220
Who is he working for?

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:51.890
The way he spoke suggests

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:54.630
that he gave the red Chaika 
this information, too.

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:57.380
Should we let the red 
Chaika steal the remains?

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:58.840
That's one way...

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:03.750
Why does Guy know about Niva?

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:06.520
Want shellfish.

00:05:06.920 --> 00:05:07.830
Shellfish?

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:11.790
Hey, you!

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:14.360
You're eating too much! 
How much have you had?!

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:15.010
Huh?

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:18.010
You eat them whole?

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:20.630
This stuff makes great 
material for my armor.

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.800
Want shellfish. Quickly.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.920
Cooking now. Wait a bit.

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:30.500
What a horrible sight.

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:33.770
An ordinary battle wouldn't result in this.

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:35.690
A magic attack, huh?

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:38.820
And one by either an 
extremely powerful wizard,

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:40.520
or a very powerful Gundo.

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:45.140
It looks like this tower was 
built using magic, too.

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:47.990
What on earth happened here?

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:50.970
The documents that Curren-san 
found in the library...

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:54.550
The lab they mentioned, where the 
emperor's fortune was hidden,

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:56.180
may have been here.

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:58.960
Where is this fortune, then?

00:06:01.550 --> 00:06:04.240
Who's there? Come out quietly!

00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:09.340
What have you come here for?

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:12.800
We're the Gillette Squad, 
employed by the Kliemann Organization

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:15.190
under the Alliance of the Six Nations.

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:16.880
The Alliance of the Six Nations?

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.350
Are you from the Gaz Empire?

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:20.810
What if we are?

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:23.770
Very well. That's enough.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.490
The war is over.

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:29.030
There is no reason we should fight here.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:31.360
We haven't come to apprehend you.

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:36.710
What happened here? Will you tell us?

00:06:39.470 --> 00:06:42.540
Two girls in white and red, 
calling themselves Chaika, were here.

00:06:43.860 --> 00:06:45.820
They had the same hair and eyes as you...

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:47.260
Don't liken me to them!

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:50.050
And what happened to those girls?

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:53.520
When the white Chaika came close,

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:57.640
the doll that Izhmash had 
made turned into a Gundo.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:04.440
So this island really was 
Emperor Gaz's secret lab.

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:07.280
Mass production of demi-human 
soldiers and Fayla,

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:10.700
and the technology to control them...

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:13.030
What use would one have 
for that outside of war?

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:19.580
Why did Izhmash continue this research, 
even after Emperor Gaz died?

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:22.510
The emperor told him to do so.

00:07:23.090 --> 00:07:25.590
He said it would become necessary 
even after his death.

00:07:26.850 --> 00:07:27.840
Chaika...

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:32.420
In other words, Chaika Gaz may be
 the calamity that brings war again

00:07:32.850 --> 00:07:35.350
to this peaceful world 
that we finally obtained.

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:39.270
We must not let Chaika gather his remains.

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:42.560
You're saying Chaika took 
that Gundo away, correct?

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:46.190
Yes. The doll followed her voluntarily.

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:48.860
Is that enough?

00:07:50.050 --> 00:07:51.860
Do you intend to stay here?

00:07:52.330 --> 00:07:53.780
We're not going back.

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:56.330
There's no place for us on the mainland.

00:07:57.130 --> 00:07:59.550
Don't concern yourselves 
with us any further.

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:08.230
We can infer that the Gundo that Chaika 
took was the emperor's fortune.

00:08:08.610 --> 00:08:11.550
So if Chaika, his daughter, has it now...

00:08:12.100 --> 00:08:15.740
The Gundo could use his remains 
to become a powerful weapon

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:20.520
and plunge the world into war again, huh...

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:24.560
Yes... But I will not let that happen.

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:29.610
Fuchan...

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:34.030
"The Gillette Squad is to head

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:35.950
for the Principality of Hartgen at once.

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:37.820
One of the eight heroes,

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:41.510
King Hartgen, is suspected of gathering 
soldiers for a military expansion.

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:45.170
Investigate immediately," it says.

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:49.400
If he's one of the eight heroes, 
Chaika should head there for the remains.

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:52.020
Yeah. We're heading to the 
Principality of Hartgen.

00:08:55.390 --> 00:08:56.430
Toru...

00:08:57.400 --> 00:09:01.240
Gathering remains, purpose... 
for father's funeral.

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:03.790
But I am orphan.

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:06.270
Not Emperor Gaz's daughter.

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:09.220
Understand well.

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:12.000
But still have desire to collect remains.

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:13.350
Yeah.

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:16.280
I understand why you'd 
wonder what you could gain

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:18.460
by gathering his remains now.

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:22.240
But I don't care. I'm resolved to this.

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:28.020
I don't know what will happen 
after we gather them all.

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:31.630
But we just have to keep going 
until you feel satisfied.

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:34.720
I've made my decision to stay until the end.

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:36.840
Toru...

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:43.510
I am back, Brother.

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:48.640
I've brought back a great haul of mollusks.

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:51.430
I can't guess how they taste, 
but that is no problem.

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:53.730
We should cut them into chunks and 
season them with something sour.

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:57.380
They're the mollusks you asked for, Brother.

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:59.200
I didn't ask for those.

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:00.940
Why'd you put it on my head?!

00:10:00.940 --> 00:10:04.160
You don't realize that you look 
manlier with that on your head?!

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:02.780
Cut it out!

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:13.710
Chaika!

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:15.280
Are you kidding me?

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:16.300
It's starting already?

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:22.340
So the entire ground inside 
these walls is a battlefield?

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:25.310
Defeat quickly!

00:10:28.630 --> 00:10:30.270
Sadica, asdic, rimazo...

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:32.650
That which protects and defends, come!

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:44.830
You've passed the qualifying round.

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:49.800
The tournament may be fought 
in groups of two to three.

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:53.790
You may use any weapon you 
can hold in your hands.

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:57.390
Use any armor or defensive gear you like.

00:10:57.390 --> 00:10:58.800
Of course, Gundos are also permitted.

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.610
Will you three participate as a group?

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:02.280
Yeah.

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:04.440
Then tie those cloths around your arms.

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:06.310
They identify you as participants.

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:10.020
Then proceed to the barracks 
inside the second wall.

00:11:10.780 --> 00:11:14.670
King Hartgen adheres to true martial arts.

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:16.620
In other words, while we 
call this a tournament,

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:18.940
it is a battle in which 
your lives are at stake.

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.360
Know that.

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:23.520
It's like a war.

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:24.920
Oh? Want to withdraw?

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:25.700
No.

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:28.190
He said it starts in two days, right?

00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:30.660
So we have to wait in the 
barracks until then?

00:11:31.610 --> 00:11:33.070
Does your wound hurt?

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:34.250
It's nothing serious.

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:36.980
David, must not overdo.

00:11:36.980 --> 00:11:39.080
Hey, come on, Chaika.

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:42.720
Hearing kind words like that 
from you just makes me worried.

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:47.460
Forget about me. 
Just think about your own goal.

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:50.490
You're going to get the prize of the remains

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:53.310
and then take all the ones 
the white girl has, right?

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:55.690
Obvious. No point asking now.

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:58.100
Then let's get in there and do this!

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:03.840
Remains white Chaika has, 
tournament prize...

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:05.370
Take all.

00:12:14.270 --> 00:12:16.600
I'll get rid of you before the tournament!

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:18.160
Just try it!

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.470
You two, stop it!

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:23.050
If you keep this up, you'll be disqualified!

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:36.930
Clean this up.

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:38.860
Who is he?

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:39.890
You don't know?

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:43.840
The king realized he had talent 
and hired him as a bodyguard.

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:48.450
He didn't have to kill them...

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:51.900
They call it a martial arts tournament,

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:53.910
but it's just a killing match.

00:12:54.190 --> 00:12:55.380
Killing match?

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:56.140
Yep.

00:12:56.140 --> 00:13:00.340
But is there some reason for the 
participants to risk their lives?

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:03.420
Well, the winner receives 
money and high status.

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:07.510
They say the winner will be employed 
as a knight in the castle,

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:13.260
and the king will give him the treasure 
he earned for subjugating the emperor.

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:14.520
Treasure?

00:13:14.520 --> 00:13:15.730
Take my advice.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:20.000
You don't want to go near that 
town until the tournament's over.

00:13:22.310 --> 00:13:26.090
Guy was right. 
Ordinary means won't be enough here.

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:30.930
The Principality of Hartgen

00:13:30.930 --> 00:13:33.580
has always encouraged citizens 
to learn martial arts,

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:37.620
but after the king returned from 
the war, the tournament changed.

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:40.710
Participants are now entering 
the castle in droves.

00:13:41.220 --> 00:13:42.840
Why fight to the death?

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:45.600
It's hard to believe they're sane.

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:46.630
Yeah...

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:50.420
All right, Matheus and Zita, 
seek an audience with King Hartgen

00:13:50.420 --> 00:13:51.760
and try to get a feel for him.

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:55.380
Vivi and I will sneak into the 
tournament disguised as participants.

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:58.520
Leonardo, find out who the participants are.

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:03.560
Aida, fual, alluel...

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:06.030
Come, to surround and hide!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:07.670
The Concealer!

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:14.160
Okay! Perfect cover!

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:19.260
Goeranson Castle walls, extremely high.

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:20.630
Infiltrate, difficult?

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:23.560
Yeah. We'll have to go in through the front.

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:25.710
Does that mean we'll participate 
in the tournament?

00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:28.380
I can participate, too, right?

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:30.370
Yes. Need your help, Fredrica.

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:33.780
Just leave it to me! 
I finally get to go nuts again!

00:14:33.780 --> 00:14:35.430
Go nuts! Welcome!

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:36.720
Hey...

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:40.460
Brother, it may be a good idea 
to accept a dragoon's help.

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:41.810
You're right.

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:45.320
Infiltrate castle walls, 
then search for remains.

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:47.200
Search needed?

00:14:47.200 --> 00:14:50.530
Yes. Search, then take remains.

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:53.680
Take remains, mission complete?

00:14:53.680 --> 00:14:56.510
Yes. Then, with luck, escape.

00:14:57.090 --> 00:14:59.450
Must search for remains immediately.

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:01.450
Yes. Niva, wise.

00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:03.880
Wise? Unexpected.

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.340
Niva, modest.

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:08.260
Modest. Word used by people of skill.

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:09.590
That means modest!

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:11.930
Niva, fun! Good person!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:14.680
Not person. I am Gundo.

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:17.890
No difference. Niva, have personality!

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:39.530
King Hartgen, it is an honor to meet you.

00:15:40.060 --> 00:15:43.500
I am Matheus Callaway, a vice captain 
of the Kliemann Organization.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:45.680
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:48.580
I will not cancel the 
martial arts tournament.

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:52.580
Nor will I return the emperor's remains.

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:57.010
Would you two care to participate, as well?

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:04.520
Hey, these guys are serious!

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:05.860
You're going too easy, Nikolai!

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:22.880
What's going on?

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.290
They're not in their right mind.

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:25.920
You pass.

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:31.280
It's already begun.

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:31.840
Yes.

00:16:32.390 --> 00:16:35.720
Let us in! We wish to participate 
in the tournament!

00:16:41.970 --> 00:16:43.110
Where'd they go?

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:49.530
Come, to strike and crush!

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:51.360
The Slugger!

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:57.490
Defeat, success!

00:16:58.210 --> 00:17:01.020
It's over already? 
I didn't get to do anything!

00:17:01.400 --> 00:17:03.780
Fredrica, strongest. Save for now.

00:17:03.780 --> 00:17:06.220
Aw, what the heck?!

00:17:06.220 --> 00:17:07.760
You've passed the qualifying round.

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:09.260
Tie these on your arms.

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:10.690
They identify you as participants.

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:13.920
Is that girl a spectator?

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:16.640
Uh... She's a reserve fighter.

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:34.480
Hi there. Nice to see you're well.

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:36.530
Who are you?

00:17:36.830 --> 00:17:40.170
That's your greeting? 
And after I saved you...

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:41.670
What are you talking about?

00:17:42.070 --> 00:17:45.160
Oh, that's right. You don't remember.

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:49.460
I saw the hatred within your heart.

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:52.210
That's why I saved your life.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:27.710
I think you've realized

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:30.380
that even as you lived 
in a world without war,

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:33.300
you always felt that something wasn't right.

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:38.760
The doubt and uncertainty toward 
this world that swirl in your heart

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:43.880
are proof that you are incapable 
of living in this peaceful world.

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:47.020
That is why you drew your sword, yes?

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:50.860
Against the deceptive justice 
that was willing to

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:53.130
sacrifice your precious subordinates.

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:55.960
And so you attempted to kill your opponent.

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:57.570
I...

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.200
You should work for the king.

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:01.280
What do you mean?

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:02.800
Who are you?

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:05.500
You'll know soon enough.

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.290
White Chaika will come.

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:16.710
This time...

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:20.560
I know Chaika will come here.

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:23.610
I know it.

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:45.290
Captain Nikolai and Vivi are among 
the participants as planned.

00:19:45.650 --> 00:19:47.580
I told them about the 
black Chaikas, as well.

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:52.620
They have also seen the white 
and red Chaikas on the grounds.

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:55.610
It appears they intend to 
participate in the tournament.

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:56.610
They do?

00:19:56.610 --> 00:19:59.970
Then the red and white Chaikas 
aren't working for Hartgen?

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:03.590
They must have found out that the grand 
prize was the emperor's remains.

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:07.810
That must mean the black Chaikas 
we saw with King Hartgen are...

00:20:09.630 --> 00:20:10.790
Matheus-san?

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:11.590
Yeah...

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:14.590
Leo, they haven't seen your face yet.

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:15.830
Run from here.

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:21.400
King Hartgen has ordered us 
to entertain his guests.

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:23.360
Please accompany us.

00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:28.720
Efun... Heluste... Ru... 
Belguil... Fai... Sev...

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:30.770
Come, resounding perception.

00:20:30.770 --> 00:20:32.250
The Locator!

00:20:35.820 --> 00:20:38.420
Remains, inside castle. Deep place.

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:40.190
Beneath the castle, then?

00:20:40.190 --> 00:20:42.120
Let's just go as far as we can.

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:45.030
If it looks like we can steal them, we will.

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:48.430
Then we won't have to be 
in this stupid tournament.

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:52.180
Chaika, you wait in the barracks.

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:56.190
Toru, Akari. Caution, very important.

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:59.180
Don't worry. We won't do anything crazy.

00:20:59.180 --> 00:21:00.070
We'll be back.

00:21:01.250 --> 00:21:02.080
Right.

00:21:15.920 --> 00:21:16.920
Shall we go?

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:24.810
Niva! Unknown person!

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:27.900
Your work is done.

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:29.300
Explain!

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:33.880
Bringing this girl here 
was part of your mission.

00:21:34.440 --> 00:21:35.440
You've completed that.

00:21:35.920 --> 00:21:37.260
Don't understand...

00:21:37.650 --> 00:21:39.150
No need to worry.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:41.440
Niva, agreed to go with Guy?

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:43.400
Voluntarily agreed.

00:21:44.590 --> 00:21:46.130
It's as she says.

00:21:46.130 --> 00:21:48.320
You don't need to worry about a thing.

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:30.470
Principality of Hartgen, 
inside Goeranson Castle, many violent men!

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:32.230
Muscles everywhere!

00:23:32.230 --> 00:23:33.680
Full of bloodlust!

00:23:33.680 --> 00:23:36.470
I am frightened...

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:39.980
Black Agenda

00:23:36.980 --> 00:23:39.080
Next time: "Black Agenda."
